# Bug hunt round 1 (trains): every car of the standing train, used as he uses it (looking at it from the platform):
# a coach seats him, the engine takes him into its cab; nothing leaves him inside a wall when he steps off.
stream on
train at station
survival on
face train car 1
ride train car 1
expect riding == 1
hold sneak 0.1
tick 0.5
expect riding == 0
expect player.inblock == 0
face train car 2
ride train car 2
expect riding == 1
hold sneak 0.1
tick 0.5
expect riding == 0
expect player.inblock == 0
face train car 3
ride train car 3
expect riding == 1
hold sneak 0.1
tick 0.5
expect riding == 0
expect player.inblock == 0
